      "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles"
     },
     "body": "<p>In addition, I'd note that the <a href=\"https://solid.mit.edu/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Solid team</a> is has published <a href=\"https://github.com/solid/web-access-control-spec\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">a specification</a> for how WebAccessControl is used in the Solid platform. Obviously, this is not entirely applicable to Fedora, but could be a useful reference in the future. For example, see the <a href=\"https://github.com/solid/web-access-control-spec#groups-of-agents\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">spec's section on groups of agents</a>.</p>",
